33:**Legacy key fallback (deprecated, removed in v3.3.0).** The retired `github.spec_git_workflow` key in `.moai/config/sections/system.yaml` is read ONLY when `git_strategy.{mode}.workflow` is absent AND that legacy key is present — a stale, hand-edited configuration. In that case apply the mapping below and emit a deprecation warning naming the canonical key `git_strategy.{mode}.workflow` and the removal version v3.3.0.
